 │  › ○ Live · Cloudflare + domain │ │ notifications, also called webhooks).                                           │
 │    ○ Live · ngrok               │ │                                                                                 │
 │    ○ Live · Tailscale Funnel    │ │ You need   cloudflared, a Cloudflare account and a domain   ✓ installed         │
 │    ○ Live · my own URL          │ │            (2026.9.3)                                                           │
 │    ○ Live · custom command      │ │            admin rights on the repos you pick                                   │
 ╰─────────────────────────────────╯ │ Setup      ●●○ a named tunnel                                                   │
